    "description": "<p><span>Protect your phone without hiding its original beauty.</span></p>\n<p><span>Our Transparent Magnetic Wireless Charging Phone Case is crafted with a TPU + Acrylic hybrid build, offering a perfect balance of clarity, strength, and everyday protection.</span></p>\n<p>✨ Clear &amp; Premium Look<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Crystal-clear acrylic back panel that showcases your phone’s original color</span></li>\n<li><span>Resistant to yellowing for long-lasting transparency</span></li>\n<li><span>Smooth, glossy finish for a modern premium feel</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Durable TPU Protection<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Flexible TPU bumper absorbs shocks and protects edges</span></li>\n<li><span>Soft yet sturdy frame for comfortable grip</span></li>\n<li><span>Raised edges around camera and screen for added safety</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Magnetic Wireless Charging Compatible<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Built-in magnetic ring ensures stable wireless charging</span></li>\n<li><span>Compatible with magnetic chargers and accessories</span></li>\n<li><span>No need to remove the case while charging</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perfect Fit &amp; Easy Access<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Precision cut-outs for camera, ports, and speakers</span></li>\n<li><span>Responsive button covers for effortless use</span></li>\n<li><span>Slim profile without adding bulk</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Stylish Color Frames<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>• Available in trendy frame colors like Orange and Navy Blue, adding a bold outline to your clear case.<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> Why Choose This Case?<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>✔ TPU + Acrylic hybrid material<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span>✔ Transparent, non-frosted back</span></p>\n<p><span>✔ Magnetic wireless charging support</span></p>\n<p><span>✔ Camera &amp; screen protection</span></p>\n<p><span>✔ Lightweight and everyday-friendly</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Package Includes<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>1 × Transparent Magnetic Wireless Charging Phone Case</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>",
    "bullets": [
      "Optical-Grade Clarity: UV-resistant acrylic backplate preserves original phone color",
      "Hybrid Drop Defense: High-density shock-absorbing perimeter bumper protects edges",
      "Integrated MagSafe Array: Embedded 38-magnet ring ensures rapid wireless charging",
      "Raised Perimeter Bezels: 1.2mm elevated lips shield display and camera lenses",
      "Precision Port Cutouts: Responsive button caps provide crisp tactile feedback"
    ],
    "raw_html": "<p class=\"pdp-desc-lead\">Protect your phone without compromising its iconic design. The Covertok Transparent Magnetic Case features an optical-grade acrylic backplate fused with an impact-absorbing TPU bumper, delivering military-grade drop defense while preserving your phone's authentic silhouette.</p><div class=\"pdp-desc-section\"><h4 class=\"pdp-desc-heading\">Design &amp; Engineering</h4><ul class=\"pdp-desc-list\"><li><strong>Optical-Grade Clarity:</strong> UV-stabilized acrylic backplate engineered to resist yellowing and retain crystal-clear transparency.</li><li><strong>Hybrid Drop Defense:</strong> High-density shock-absorbing perimeter bumper protects edges against impacts and everyday drops.</li><li><strong>Raised Perimeter Bezels:</strong> 1.2mm elevated lips shield camera lenses and front display from direct surface contact.</li></ul></div><div class=\"pdp-desc-section\"><h4 class=\"pdp-desc-heading\">Charging &amp; Ergonomics</h4><ul class=\"pdp-desc-list\"><li><strong>Precision MagSafe Array:</strong> Embedded 38-magnet ring ensures instant snap-on alignment with fast wireless chargers and magnetic mounts.</li><li><strong>Tactile Button Covers:</strong> Independently responsive button caps provide crisp, effortless tactile feedback.</li><li><strong>Architectural Color Accent:</strong> Precision-molded contrast frame adds an intentional aesthetic outline to the transparent casing.</li></ul></div><div class=\"pdp-desc-section\"><h4 class=\"pdp-desc-heading\">In The Box</h4><ul class=\"pdp-desc-list\"><li>1 × Covertok Transparent Magnetic Case</li><li>1 × Official 1-Year Quality Warranty Card</li></ul></div>",
