    "model_label": "Select Device Model:",
    "description": "<div></div>\n<div>The Rhode Lip Case is the ultimate blend of style and function – a sleek protective phone cover designed with a built-in slot for your favorite Rhode Peptide Lip Treatment. Perfect for beauty lovers on the go, it keeps your phone safe while making sure your lip balm is always within reach.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>✨ Features:</div>\n<div><span> • Designed to hold Rhode Peptide Lip Treatment securely</span></div>\n<div><span> • Slim, protective cover for everyday use</span></div>\n<div><span> • Available in multiple colors to match your vibe</span></div>\n<div><span> • Sleek and minimal design with the Rhode aesthetic</span></div>\n<div><span> • Compatible with various iPhone models</span></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Pair it with any of the Rhode Lip Tint shades – Ribbon, Toast, Raspberry Jelly, PBJ, or Espresso– to keep your phone case as stylish as your lips.</div>",
