    "body_html": "<p><span>Experience the pure look and feel of your iPhone with this sideless ultra-clear back case, designed for minimalists who don’t want to hide the phone’s original design.</span></p>\n<p>The case features a high-clarity, anti-yellow hard back that stays transparent over time, while the open sideless design keeps the natural grip and premium feel of your iPhone intact. Lightweight and sleek, it adds protection to the back without adding bulk or altering the phone’s aesthetics.<br><span></span></p>\n<p>Perfect for users who prefer a clean, modern, and barely-there look.<br><span></span></p>\n<p>Key Features:<br><span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Sideless open-frame design</span></li>\n<li><span>Anti-yellow crystal clear hard back</span></li>\n<li><span>Ultra-slim &amp; lightweight</span></li>\n<li><span>Scratch-resistant back panel</span></li>\n<li><span>Maintains original phone look &amp; feel</span></li>\n<li>\n<span>Easy snap-on fiT     <br></span>Compatibility:</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>iPhone Pro &amp; Pro Max models (model-specific)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>",
