    "body_html": "<p>Stay charged in style with Covertok.<br>This ultra-slim 5000mAh/ 10000mAh power bank is designed for modern lifestyles – lightweight, sleek, and powerful. With its digital LED display, you always know your battery status. Perfectly pocket-sized, it ensures your devices never run out of power on the go.</p>\n<p>✅ 5000mAh High Capacity – Enough to keep your devices powered all day.<br>✅ Slim &amp; Stylish Design – Fits easily in your pocket or bag.<br>✅ Digital LED Display – Real-time battery percentage indicator.<br>✅ Fast Charging Output – Quick and efficient charging whenever you need it.<br>✅ Premium Build Quality – Durable, elegant, and made for everyday use.</p>\n<p>• 📱 Magnetic Attachment – Snaps onto your phone securely.<br> • ⚡ Wireless Charging – Say goodbye to messy cables.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>1-Month Warranty – your purchase is covered for any manufacturing defects</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>",
