    "description": "<p>Description:<br>Stand out with this rugged transparent protective case and striking orange strap for Apple Watch. Built for durability and a sporty lifestyle, it offers full-body protection against shocks, scratches, and accidental drops while keeping your watch’s sleek design visible. The soft yet sturdy silicone strap ensures all-day comfort, making it perfect for workouts, outdoor activities, and everyday wear. Designed with precise cutouts for the crown, buttons, and sensors, it guarantees effortless functionality with maximum protection.</p>\n<p>✅ 360° rugged shockproof protection<br>✅ Transparent case with stylish orange strap<br>✅ Comfortable, sweat-resistant silicone band<br>✅ Easy to install with secure screw-lock frame<br>✅ Ideal for sports, fitness, and daily use</p>",
