    "body_html": "<div>📝 Description:</div>\n<div>Make your phone extra adorable with the Cute Plush Bear Lanyard Phone Case. Designed with a soft teddy bear patch on a leather-textured TPU case, this cover blends cuteness and practicality. It comes with a handy wrist/hand strap, making it easier to carry while keeping your phone safe from scratches, drops, a<img>nd dust.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>✨ Features:</div>\n<div><span> • Adorable plush teddy bear design on the back</span></div>\n<div><span> • Premium leather-textured TPU for durability &amp; style</span></div>\n<div><span> • Shock-absorbing and scratch-resistant</span></div>\n<div><span> • Comes with a matching lanyard strap for easy carrying</span></div>\n<div><span> • Lightweight yet protective design</span></div>\n<div><span> • Available in White, Black, and Brown</span></div>\n<div><span> • Compatible with multiple iPhone models</span></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Perfect for those who love cute, fashionable, and functional accessories, this phone case will keep your phone protected while adding a cozy teddy bear charm. 🧸💖</div>\n<p> </p>",
