    "model_label": "Select Model",
    "description": "<p>Description:<br>Protect your AirPods in style with our TPU Butterfly Charm Cases. Made from high-quality flexible TPU material, these cases provide reliable protection against scratches, bumps, and everyday wear while staying slim and lightweight. Designed with delicate butterfly prints in pastel pink and sky blue, they bring an elegant, dreamy vibe. Each case includes a detachable beaded butterfly keychain for extra charm and convenience—perfect for carrying or clipping to your bag. A blend of durability and aesthetic beauty in one!</p>",
    "bullets": [],
    "raw_html": "<p>Description:<br>Protect your AirPods in style with our TPU Butterfly Charm Cases. Made from high-quality flexible TPU material, these cases provide reliable protection against scratches, bumps, and everyday wear while staying slim and lightweight. Designed with delicate butterfly prints in pastel pink and sky blue, they bring an elegant, dreamy vibe. Each case includes a detachable beaded butterfly keychain for extra charm and convenience—perfect for carrying or clipping to your bag. A blend of durability and aesthetic beauty in one!</p>",
    "in_stock": true,
