    "description": "<p>A wallet. A stand. A statement.</p>\n<p>Introducing the MagSafe leather Wallet Stand, a premium 2-in-1 accessory that snaps securely to your iPhone and transforms into a kickstand whenever needed. Carry your cards and cash effortlessly, while enjoying hands-free viewing at any time.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>🧲 Key Features:</p>\n<p>– MagSafe Compatible: Strong magnetic grip for secure snap-on attachment.</p>\n<p>– Built-in Kickstand: Easily folds out to support vertical or horizontal viewing.</p>\n<p>– Premium PU Leather: Smooth, durable finish with an elegant look.</p>\n<p>– Slim Design: Pocket-friendly without compromising space.</p>\n<p>– Secure Card Slot: Holds 1–2 cards snugly.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>📱 Compatibility: MagSafe-enabled iPhones (12/13/14/15/16 Series)</p>",
